# Kylox, Visionary Inventor: "any number" of spells, so fewer than all. Two Memnites are sacrificed (X = 2) and two Lightning
# Bolts exiled; Bot1 casts one for nothing at Bot2 (3 damage) and declines the second, which stays in exile. Bot2: 20 - 3 - 4 = 13.

